  "about_item": [
    "Dog Stretcher is crafted from select Oxford fabric, which is tough enough to easily withstand up to 300 pounds, while being smooth and delicate to the touch, providing a thoughtful experience for the user.",
    "The Dog Stretcher for Large Dogs measures 48 x 40 inches, and its spacious design makes it easy to transport large dogs, whether it's a larger Labrador or a German Shepherd, it's a perfect fit and meets the needs of a wide range of dog breeds.",
    "The Portable Stretcher's lightweight design and unique foldable structure make it extremely easy to store and take up very little space. With a light weight of only 450g, the stretcher can be easily carried outside on a daily basis or used indoors, providing comfortable support for your pet anytime, anywhere.",
    "Emergency Animal Carrier Unlike traditional stretcher bars with fixed supports, this stretcher bar features a flexible oxford fabric design. It not only retains excellent toughness and support, but is also able to adjust its shape at will according to actual needs, making it easy to use in narrow environments, greatly expanding the use scenarios, whether it is a narrow passageway indoors or a complex terrain outdoors, it can easily cope with the situation.",
    "In terms of appearance design, the stretcher adopts a modernized style, and the exquisite pattern on the fabric surface breaks the monotony of the traditional stretcher, making the whole stretcher look more fashionable and comfortable, which is not only a practical pet accessory, but also a piece of home decorations with a sense of aesthetics."
  ],
